# Build context for deployment/backend.Dockerfile and deployment/frontend.Dockerfile.
#
# Both images build with the REPOSITORY ROOT as their context, so everything the
# images do not need is excluded here. Without this file, `node_modules` and
# `dist` would be uploaded to the Docker daemon on every single build.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.angular
**/tmp
**/out-tsc
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# Secrets: a local .env must never be baked into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/*.log

.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
docs
